  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "Hotel brands commonly considered for **design-forward** or **distinctive-character lifestyle** positioning in the Caribbean and Latin America include **Design Hotels**, **Mr & Mrs Smith**, **Small Luxury Hotels of the World (SLH)**, and **The Luxury Collection**.[1][3][7][6]\n\nA few other brands or affiliations also show up in this positioning:\n- **Margaritaville** in the Caribbean, where it is described as expanding across the region with resort and all-inclusive presence.[2]\n- **The Luxury Collection** in particular, which is explicitly described as offering *refined design*, *destination-driven luxury*, and an *intimate, design-forward retreat* at Almare in Isla Mujeres.[6]\n- Independent or boutique-curated hotel groups such as **Design Hotels**, **Mr & Mrs Smith**, and **SLH**, which are specifically presented as collections of stylish or boutique stays in the Caribbean.[1][3][7]\n\nIf you mean **brands owners actually evaluate for conversion or soft-brand affiliation**, the strongest “design/lifestyle” names in the search results are **Design Hotels**, **Mr & Mrs Smith**, **SLH**, and **The Luxury Collection**.[1][3][7][6]",
